      "title": "Charge precedes shipment",
      "text": "PlaceOrder prepares the order, charges the card, then ships it. Charge errors return Internal; shipment errors return Unavailable.",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-demo/blob/dedc0178918e260823323b8d95005a8cb924b007/src/checkout/main.go#L344-L377",
